---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Strip from '../components/Strip.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config.mjs';
---

<Base
  title={`Privacy | ${site.shortName}`}
  description={`How ${site.name} handles visitor information.`}
>
  <Strip title="Privacy" crumbs={[{ href: '/privacy/', label: 'Privacy' }]} />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p><strong>Last updated: November 16, 2026.</strong></p>
      <h2>What this site collects</h2>
      <p>
        This site has no forms, no accounts, no advertising trackers and no analytics scripts. It
        does not set cookies. We do not collect personal information through the site itself.
      </p>
      <p>
        The company that hosts the site may keep standard server logs, such as IP address, browser
        type and the pages requested, for security and reliability.
      </p>
      <h2>When you contact the dealer</h2>
      <p>
        If you call, text or email, we receive whatever you choose to send, such as your name,
        phone number, email address and details about your equipment. We use it only to answer you
        and to help with AMSOIL products. We do not sell it or share it for marketing.
      </p>
      <h2>Links to AMSOIL</h2>
      <p>
        Links to the AMSOIL website take you to a site operated by AMSOIL INC., which has its own
        privacy policy. Orders, accounts and payments are handled there, not here.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Contact the dealer using the details on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> to ask
        what information we hold about you or to have it deleted.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
